# Runtime state and user-supplied input.
#
# These patterns are ANCHORED with a leading slash on purpose. An unanchored
# `data/` matches at any depth and silently swallowed the entire
# tradingbot/data/ source package, so the pushed repository could not even be
# imported. tests/test_repo_hygiene.py exists to catch that class of mistake.
/data/
/runs/
/config/security_map.json
*.csv
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-shm
*.sqlite3-wal
profiles.json
